Today is a very nice morning.
I am standing at the bus stop.
I wait for the BEST bus.
There are many vehicles on the street.
Today, I need to get to the metro station.
So, I travel by bus.
Other people are also standing at the stop.
They are all going to work.
After a short while, a red bus approaches.
That is my bus.
The bus stops at the stop.
The doors of the bus open.
Some people step down from the bus.
Then I step forward.
I confidently board the bus.
I hold the bus handrail tightly.
Now I am secure.
The bus starts again.
